// Backup and Recovery Destruction Before Encryption
// Detects deletion of backup catalogs and disabling of Windows recovery, which ransomware does immediately before encrypting so victims cannot roll back. This usually fires minutes ahead of the encryption itself.
// techniques: T1490   severity: critical
// source: rules/impact/backup-deletion-wbadmin-bcdedit.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where (((CommandLine contains "wbadmin delete")) or ((CommandLine contains "recoveryenabled no" or CommandLine contains "bootstatuspolicy ignoreallfailures")))
